 R←code hasForm dummy;ns
⍝ Does this application namespace already hold a Form?
⍝ Used to decide whether a form is the session's first (see PRIMARYFIRSTFORM in
⍝ ∆WC). Objects live in the caller as namespaces carrying a Type.
 R←0
 :For ns :In code.⎕NL ¯9
     :Trap 0
         :If 'form'≡⎕C(code⍎ns).Type ⋄ →0⊣R←1 ⋄ :EndIf
     :EndTrap
 :EndFor
